    "detailed_description": "Welcome to PNGTuber Plus!<br><br><br>PNGTuber Plus is a piece of software that allows more customization for 2D png vtubers while maintaining simplicity and approachability for beginners.<br><br>Features:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Add any .png image that you'd like<br></li><li>Allow sprites to move via sine waves<br></li><li>Allow sprites to attach to other sprites<br></li><li>Allow sprites to drag behind movement, both positionally and rotationally<br></li><li>Allow sprites to bounce and jiggle!<br></li><li>Set individual sprites to appear/disappear based on speaking/blinking<br></li><li>Replace sprite images at any time<br></li><li>Lightweight and easy to use<br></li><li>Save avatars and share them with others<br></li><li>More to come in the future!</li></ul>I'd recommend reading my tutorial to get started with using PNGTuber Plus.",
    "about_the_game": "Welcome to PNGTuber Plus!<br><br><br>PNGTuber Plus is a piece of software that allows more customization for 2D png vtubers while maintaining simplicity and approachability for beginners.<br><br>Features:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Add any .png image that you'd like<br></li><li>Allow sprites to move via sine waves<br></li><li>Allow sprites to attach to other sprites<br></li><li>Allow sprites to drag behind movement, both positionally and rotationally<br></li><li>Allow sprites to bounce and jiggle!<br></li><li>Set individual sprites to appear/disappear based on speaking/blinking<br></li><li>Replace sprite images at any time<br></li><li>Lightweight and easy to use<br></li><li>Save avatars and share them with others<br></li><li>More to come in the future!</li></ul>I'd recommend reading my tutorial to get started with using PNGTuber Plus.",
    "short_description": "A simple, artist friendly way to make pngtubers that are more fun and lively!",
